<title>USA: Federated Department names Stern's executive.</title>
<headline>Federated Department names Stern's executive.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federated Department Stores Inc said it named James Andress president and chief operating officer of its New Jersey-based Stern's department store division, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Andress, 51, has served as senior vice president of human resources and consumer affairs at the company's Macy's East division, in New York, since April 1995.</p>
<p>Andress succeeds Len Marcus, whom Federated named president of its New York merchandising division in June.</p>
